==Strategy==
This stage is incredibly easy. Use [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] or [[Crazed Fish Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Island]] to kill the Sir Seals, preferably the former, and because of the constant stream of sir seals you're pretty much guaranteed to always have tons of cash. Using [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] is your best bet in dealing with the Cli-One quickly: Simply pick a time when there are no seals in the way, then rush Awakened Bahamut Cat in so he can deal tons of damage. Even on 3 and 4 crown, Awakened Bahamut and Courier make this stage a complete joke. Make sure to not allow the enemies to push too close to your base, since the Zir Zeals will be able to burrow all the way to it, potentially leading to a loss. If you own all of the [[Anti-unstarred Alien Treasures]], the aliens are not an issue.

